        "Description": "Deja vu, 47?\r\rYour targets today are &apos;Isabella Caruso&apos; and &apos;Thomas Cross&apos;, both famously wealthy individuals, and both famously dead.\r\rWe are unsure as to whom these impersonators actually are, or what their ulterior motive is, but our client has asked us to put an end to their masquerade before it gets out of hand.\r\rA helicopter is waiting for your extraction. Best of luck, 47.",
